<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Davox raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Davox raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Kaufman Bros. LP said it raised its short-term rating on Davox Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said Davox's business continues to demonstrate exceptional momentum.</p>
<p>-- said 12-18 month price target remains $48 a share.</p>
<p>-- Davox gained 1-1/4 to 36-1/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
